# Where the commerce API lives.
#
# A rider's phone is never on your dev machine, so on a real device this has to
# be a reachable host — your LAN IP in development, e.g.
# API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.20:5055
# Leave unset in development: the app reaches the API on the computer running
# `npx expo start` by itself. Set it only to use another server.
# API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.36:5055
